{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of sequences kept in a radix tree (Morrison, 1968): a trie in which every chain of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices with one child and no key is merged into one edge labelled with all its symbols."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Tries\/Se","doc:\/\/Tries\/SE","doc:\/\/Tries\/SQ","doc:\/\/Tries\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/Tries\/SH","doc:\/\/Tries\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Tries\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Tries\/ST","doc:\/\/Tries\/s10SetAlgebraP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"RadixTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Tries\/RadixTree.swift#L27"},"title":"RadixTree","externalID":"s:5Tries9RadixTreeV","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RadixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RadixTree"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Tries"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/Trie"],"anchor":"Sets-of-sequences","title":"Sets of sequences","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RadixTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Symbol","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Symbol","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It holds the same keys and answers the same queries as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree","type":"reference"},{"text":", with the same names, but has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a vertex per key and per branching point rather than per symbol: O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") vertices for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" keys,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"however long they are. That suits keys with long shared prefixes, such as file paths or URLs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Lookup, insertion and removal follow the key down from the root, O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"d","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"·","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"σ","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") for a key of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" symbols that passes ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"d"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" vertices of at most ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"σ","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" children.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let paths = RadixTree([\"\/usr\/bin\", \"\/usr\/lib\", \"\/usr\/local\/bin\"])","paths.contains(\"\/usr\/lib\")                                   \/\/ true","paths.elements(withPrefix: \"\/usr\/l\").map { String($0) }      \/\/ [\"\/usr\/lib\", \"\/usr\/local\/bin\"]","paths.longestPrefix(of: \"\/usr\/bin\/swift\").map { String($0) } \/\/ \"\/usr\/bin\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Iteration visits each key before the keys it is a prefix of. When the symbols are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", each vertex keeps its children sorted, so the keys come in lexicographic order;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise children come in the order they were first added."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices live in flat arrays with ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int32","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" links, and the edge labels are slices of one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"buffer of symbols, so the tree holds fewer than 2³¹ − 1 vertices and label symbols, and copying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it copies a few arrays only when one copy is mutated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tries\/radixtree"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/PrefixView"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init()","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init(_:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/count","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/isEmpty"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/contains(_:)-39nls","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/elements(withPrefix:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/Radi